ants. Disabled provisions and a baby-care room cater to the needs of all shoppers. ","descriptionContentTc":"引入大型日式百貨公司及各類商店食肆，使樂富廣場成為市民選購日用品和新鮮食品、享受美食和悠閒購物的必到消費熱點。<br /><br />樂富廣場內的購物好去處包括知名運動專門店和鞋店、珠寶、紅酒及雪茄專賣店。<br /><br />美食選擇亦多不勝數，如熱門麵店、馳名餅家和日本餐廳。商場內設有傷健配套和育嬰室，滿足顧客的不同需要。","descriptionContentSc":"引入大型日式百货公司及各类商店食肆，使乐富广场成为市民选购日用品和新鲜食品、享受美食和悠闲购物的必到消费热点。<br /><br />乐富广场内的购物好去处包括知名运动专门店和鞋店、珠宝、红酒及雪茄专卖店。<br /><br />美食选择亦多不胜数，如热门面店、驰名饼家和日本餐厅。商场内设有伤健配套和育婴室，满足顾客的不同需要。"},"mallInfo":{"shopCentreId":7,"propertyTypeId":1,"addressLabelEn":"Address","addressLabelTc":"地址","addressLabelSc":"地址","addressEn":"Lok Fu Place 198 Junction Road Wang Tau Hom,  Kowloon","addressTc":"九龍橫頭磡聯合道198號樂富廣場","addressSc":"九龙横头磡联合道198号乐富广场","customerHotLineLabelEn":"Customer Service Hotline","customerHotLineLabelTc":"客戶服務熱線","customerHotLineLabelSc":"客户服务热线","customerHotLine":"(852) 2338 7781","carParkEnquiryLabelEn":"Car Park Enquiry","carParkEnquiryLabelTc":"停車場查詢","carParkEnquiryLabelSc":"停车场查询","carParkEnquiry":"5487 7944","leasingEnquiryLabelEn":"Leasing Enquiry","leasingEnquiryLabelTc":"租務查詢","leasingEnquiryLabelSc":"租务查询","leasingEnquiry":"(852) 2175 1756 / 2175 1935","websiteUrlLabelEn":"","websiteUrlLabelTc":"","websiteUrlLabelSc":"","websiteUrl":"","field02En":"","field02Tc":"","field02Sc":"","specialServiceLabelEn":"Special Services","specialServiceLabelTc":"特別服務","specialServiceLabelSc":"特别服务","specialService":{"serviceNoticeTc":"特別服務","serviceNoticeSc":"特别服务","serviceNoticeEn":"Special Services","serviceList":[{"shopCentreServiceTypeId":26,"shopCentreServiceTypeNameEn":"Bridal Dressing Suite","shopCentreServiceTypeNameTc":"新娘化妝間","shopCentreServiceTypeNameSc":"新娘化妆间","shopCentreServiceThumbnailPathEn":"/linkweb/api/file/SiteAssets/SectionPages/Shop/bridal_dressing_suite.svg?v=0d72ba5a35697c91fc9dd9c0c9a38f62","shopCentreServiceThumbnailPathTc":"/linkweb/api/file/SiteAssets/SectionPages/Shop/bridal_dressing_suite.svg?v=0d72ba5a35697c91fc9dd9c0c9a38f62","shopCentreServiceThumbnailPathSc":